\newlabel{fig:factorization_ratio_bT_finitePL}{{78}{125}{The same ratio test as Fig.~\ref {fig:factorization_ratio_bT_sivers}, $R_x(|b_T|)$, repeated at each finite momentum individually. The departure from flatness grows with $|P_L|$, most visibly in the $x=0.2$ curve, which is consistent with the parameter mismatch identified in the extrapolated $j_X$ and $d_X$ values above.\relax }{figure.caption.93}{}}
