\newlabel{fig:factorization_g_amplitudes}{{79}{126}{Optimal separable factor $g(x)$ for each of the four amplitude combinations of Table~\ref {tab:factorization_amplitudes}, for all four $x$-windows (normalized so $\text {mean}[g^2]=1$). Each amplitude's $g(x)$ is dominated by a sharp rise as $x\to 0$ that steepens as the window narrows, reflecting the Bessel-function behavior at small $x$.\relax }{figure.caption.95}{}}
